# Privacy Policy for Whisky Cal

**Effective Date:** November 12, 2026  
**Last Updated:** November 12, 2026

## 1. Introduction

Welcome to Whisky Cal ("we", "our", or "the app").

Whisky Cal is a calendar, notes, productivity, and personal planning application featuring an on-device AI assistant called Whisky AI.

Your privacy is important to us. Whisky Cal is designed with a privacy-first approach. Your personal notes, tasks, check-ins, lists, and other personal information are stored locally on your device.

This Privacy Policy explains what information the app accesses, how it is used, where it is stored, and what choices you have.

By using Whisky Cal, you acknowledge the practices described in this Privacy Policy.

## 2. Information We Collect and Access

Whisky Cal is designed to minimize the collection of personal information.

### A. Information Stored on Your Device

The following information is stored locally on your device:

- Calendar events and schedules.
- Tasks, reminders, and custom event types.
- Personal notes and meeting transcripts.
- AI-generated summaries, key topics, and action items.
- Mood, energy, and daily check-ins.
- Personal lists, including books and things to watch.
- Workout logs and activity records.
- App preferences, including accent colors, focus settings, and AI personality preferences.
- Information you voluntarily provide to personalize your experience.

We do not operate a cloud account system to collect or store this personal app content.

### B. Calendar Information

Whisky Cal requests calendar permission to display and create calendar events on your device.

When you grant calendar permission:

- The app can read calendar events to display your schedule.
- The app can create events and reminders.
- Events may synchronize with Google Calendar or other calendar services configured on your device.

Calendar synchronization is managed by your device's operating system and the calendar provider. Whisky Cal does not independently operate a calendar synchronization server.

### C. Microphone and Voice Recordings

Whisky Cal may request microphone permission so you can record meetings, conversations, and personal voice notes.

Audio is processed using your phone's speech recognition capabilities to generate text transcripts.

Voice recordings and resulting transcripts are intended to remain on your device. We do not operate our own server to collect or store your recordings.

Speech recognition availability and offline functionality depend on the language packs and capabilities installed on your device.

### D. Internet and Web Search Information

Whisky AI can search the internet when you explicitly request information, research, or assistance with planning.

When you use this feature:

- Your search query is sent to the relevant search service.
- Search results are retrieved from external websites.
- The AI may inspect relevant publicly accessible web pages to help you evaluate options.
- Selected information may be used to help you create calendar events or tasks.

Only the information necessary to perform the requested search is intended to be transmitted.

Please avoid including sensitive personal information in search queries.

External search providers and websites may independently collect information according to their own privacy policies.

## 3. On-Device Artificial Intelligence

Whisky Cal uses an AI model that runs locally on your device.

The AI model is downloaded or selected by you and operates on your phone.

On-device AI features may include:

- Summarizing notes and recordings.
- Extracting key topics and action items.
- Answering questions about your notes.
- Helping organize tasks and schedules.
- Understanding natural-language calendar and planning requests.

Your notes and personal content are processed locally for these AI features.

The AI model does not require you to upload your personal notes to our servers.

Some AI-powered web search and research features require an internet connection and transmit the search queries you submit.

## 4. Third-Party Services

Whisky Cal may interact with third-party services when you choose to use certain features.

These may include:

- Search engines and web search providers.
- Google Calendar or other calendar providers configured on your device.
- Android speech recognition services.
- Google Docs, Gmail, Google Drive, Google Keep, Google Tasks, and other applications through Android's sharing functionality.

When you choose to share information with another application, that application processes the information under its own privacy policy and terms.

We do not control the privacy practices, security, or data retention policies of third-party services.

We encourage you to review the privacy policies of any external services you use.

## 5. Data Storage and Security

Whisky Cal is designed to keep personal information on your device rather than on our servers.

We do not operate a cloud database for your notes, tasks, check-ins, calendar content, or personal lists.

The security of locally stored information also depends on your device's operating system, device security settings, backups, and physical access controls.

We recommend:

- Keeping your device protected with a screen lock.
- Keeping Android and the app updated.
- Being careful when sharing personal information with other applications.
- Using secure device backups when appropriate.

We cannot guarantee absolute security of information stored on any electronic device.

## 6. Data Sharing

We do not sell, rent, or trade your personal information.

We do not independently transmit your locally stored notes, tasks, check-ins, or personal lists to advertising companies.

Information may leave your device when you:

- Explicitly request an internet search using Whisky AI.
- Share a note or other content with another application.
- Use calendar synchronization provided by your device or calendar provider.

In these situations, information is processed by the relevant third-party service.

## 7. Permissions Used by the App

Whisky Cal may request the following Android permissions:

**Microphone:** Used to record voice notes, meetings, and conversations.

**Calendar:** Used to read and create calendar events and reminders.

**Internet:** Used when you request web searches and online research through Whisky AI.

Permissions are requested to support the relevant app features. You can manage or revoke permissions through your Android device settings. Some features may not work without the corresponding permission.

## 8. Data Retention and Deletion

Your personal app information is stored locally on your device.

You can manage or delete your information through the app's available features and your device settings.

Uninstalling the app may remove locally stored app data, depending on your Android version and backup settings.

Information previously shared with third-party applications or synchronized with external calendar services may remain with those services. You may need to delete that information directly through the relevant service.

## 9. Children's Privacy

Whisky Cal is not specifically designed for children under the age of 13.

We do not knowingly collect personal information from children through our own servers.

If you believe that a child has provided personal information through an external service used by the app, please contact the relevant service provider.

## 10. Your Privacy Rights

Depending on your location and applicable privacy laws, you may have rights to:

- Access personal information.
- Correct inaccurate information.
- Delete personal information.
- Restrict certain processing.
- Object to certain data processing.
- Withdraw permissions granted to the app.

Because most personal information is stored locally on your device, you can manage much of it directly without contacting us.

## 11. Changes to This Privacy Policy

We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes to the app, its features, or applicable legal requirements.

Any updated version will be published with a revised Last Updated date.

We encourage you to review this page periodically.

